@name     scene_cue
@alias    scene_cue
@group    seq
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  queue scene change at next downbeat
@doc
Queues scene change across all 8 lanes at next downbeat. Pass -1 to queue a clean musical stop (same as scene_stop).
Usage: scene_cue scene_id (or scene_id scene_cue)
@code
    (void)voice;
    seq_scene_cue((int)args[0]);
    return 0;
@end
